<http://example.org/kg-mnp/alignments> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Domain ontology for Mobile Number Portability eligibility assessment with evidence-rule-clause-action traceability."@en .
<http://example.org/kg-mnp/alignments> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "KG-MNP Alignments"@en .
<http://example.org/kg-mnp/alignments> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "KG-MNP Compliance Ontology"@en .
<http://example.org/kg-mnp/alignments> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "KG-MNP Core Ontology"@en .
<http://example.org/kg-mnp/alignments> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Compliance-oriented extensions for regulatory operationalization and reassessment."@en .
<http://example.org/kg-mnp/alignments> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Human-reviewed source and alignment annotations. Runtime loaders may skip this file."@en .
<http://example.org/kg-mnp/alignments> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "OWL 2 concepts and stable cardinality constraints. Amount/date rules are executed in Python."@en .
<http://example.org/kg-mnp/alignments> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "0.1.0" .
